<title>USA: Tri-Continental sets capital gain payout.</title>
<headline>Tri-Continental sets capital gain payout.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tri-Continental Corp said on Friday it had set a capital gain distribution of $2.15 a share, consisting of $2.01 from a net long-term gain and $0.14 from a net short-term gain realized on investment transactions.</p>
<p>The gain will be payable on Dec 20 to shareholders of record on Dec 13, the company said.</p>
